guide forever/alliance/nightelf/02-darkshore
title Darkshore
race NightElf
faction Alliance
levels 16-21
zone Darkshore
next forever/alliance/02-westfall

# v1 improved: order from the simulator's search (NightElf Alliance, 2000000 tries, seeded with v1's order;
# 128.7 h -> 121.5 h to 60 in the model), written by polestar apply-route.
# Added here: A Fishy Peril (40).
# Left out: For Love Eternal (963), Fruit of the Sea (1138), WANTED: Murkdeep! (4740), Cave Mushrooms (947), The Absent Minded Prospector (729), Expanding Horizons (97914), Deep Ocean, Vast Sea (982), The Tower of Althalaxx (965), Buzzbox 411 (1001), Cleansing of the Infected (2138), Thundris Windweaver (4761), Tharnariun's Hope (2139), The Cliffspring River (4762), Beached Sea Creature (4730), Beached Sea Turtle (4727), Beached Sea Turtle (4725), A Lost Master (986), The Blackwood Corrupted (4763), Buzzbox 323 (1002), Buzzbox 525 (1003), Gyromast's Retrieval (2098), Onu (948), The Sleeper Has Awakened (5321), The Master's Glaive (944), Therylune's Escape (945), The Powers Below (968), The Twilight Camp (949), It's All Fun and Games Until... (98042), Return to Onu (950), The Absent Minded Prospector (731), Beached Sea Turtle (4731), Beached Sea Creature (4733), Beached Sea Turtle (4732), Mathystra Relics (951), Holy Diver (87760), A Lost Master (993), The Tower of Althalaxx (966), The Tower of Althalaxx (967), Escape Through Force (994), Trek to Ashenvale (990), Swelling Forces (98013).
# The notes above describe v1's order; the steps below are the improved one.

# Visit 3 of the simulator's consensus Alliance route (Human export,
# 16.4 to 20.5): four loops from Auberdine, then the boat to Stormwind and
# Redridge. Kerlonian, Therylune and Balthule's letter (5321, 945, 967) and
# Trek to Ashenvale (990) are turned in on the route's later Ashenvale visit.
#
# Flow: Auberdine (flight path, hearth) -> the beach -> Auberdine -> the bear
# hills -> Auberdine -> the Blackwood camp, Ameth'Aran, the red crystal,
# Bashal'Aran, the Tower of Althalaxx -> hearth -> the Blackwood camp,
# Ameth'Aran, the southern beaches, the Grove, the red crystal, Cliffspring
# Falls, the northern beaches, Bashal'Aran -> Auberdine -> the bay wrecks, the
# Ruins of Mathystra, the Tower, the northern Blackwood camp, the cave, the
# Den Mother -> hearth -> the Grove, the Master's Glaive, Murkdeep's beach ->
# Auberdine -> the naga -> hearth -> the Grove, Volcor -> Auberdine.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - For Love Eternal (963) is taken on the first pass through Auberdine and
#   done in Ameth'Aran on the first loop instead of a later return.
# - Refresh (new consensus): The Absent Minded Prospector (729, 731) is
#   taken: Trouble In Darkshore? (730) is only its breadcrumb, Archaeologist
#   Hollee gives 729 directly. Its third step (741) is left out: it ends in
#   Darnassus, a detour off the route, and the chain's last step (943) needs
#   the Stone of Relu, a 1.5% raptor drop in the Wetlands.
# - Refresh: Expanding Horizons (97914, Forever) is taken at the end:
#   Thundris Windweaver's letter goes to Baros Alexston at the Stormwind stop
#   (04-redridge-mountains), his reply (Making Do, 97926, a Shipwright's
#   Satchel) back to Thundris on the return to Auberdine (06-ashenvale).
# - Left out, accepted but never turned in on the route: One Shot. One Kill.
#   (5713): it ends at Maestra's Post, which the route reaches at 25, when
#   the level 15 quest pays a tenth of its XP. The Powers Below (968) starts
#   from a 5% book drop of the Twilight Disciples and Thugs: optional, handed
#   in at the Ironforge stop (06-ashenvale).
# - The Lakeshire flight path and hearth the export lists at the end of this
#   visit are taken on arrival in Redridge (next guide).
# - Auberdine, on the return from Bashal'Aran: one round of the town, from
#   Terenthis by the road in to Thundris last; Thundris (4763), Terenthis
#   (986) and Gwennyth (87760) give their next quests on the same visit as
#   the turn-ins instead of a second round.
# - Holy Diver (87760, Forever): Gwennyth offers it only once all nine
#   Beached Sea Creature and Turtle quests are handed in (players'
#   reports, #51; the quest data has no prerequisite for it). It is taken
#   with the last three after the fourth loop, its rod comes from the
#   Stormscale Beastmistresses on the naga trip, and it is handed in on the
#   way back south.
# - Beached Sea Creature (4723) is taken on the first loop, on the walk from
#   Asterion down to Buzzbox 411 that passes it, and handed in at the first
#   hearth (#213), instead of a detour from Cliffspring Falls on the second.
#   The three remains past Remtravel's Excavation (4731-4733) stay on the
#   fourth loop: Greymist Oracles and Tidehunters (18-20) guard them, which
#   the second loop reaches at about 18.
# - The Blackwood Corrupted (4763, #302): the Empty Cleansing Bowl is filled
#   at the Auberdine Moonwell right after Thundris gives the quest, and the
#   three Blackwood samples, the bowl and the Talisman are a step of their
#   own at the northern Blackwood camp, on the way from the Tower to the
#   cave. The quest's only objective is the Talisman, but Xabraxxis comes
#   only for the mixed bowl.
#
# Optional: The Family and the Fishing Pole (1141) needs Fishing.
# Gyromast's Revenge (2078) ends with the Threshwackonator 4100, an elite: not
# taken. The Tower of Althalaxx 1143 and 981 need 1167 from Delgren in
# Ashenvale (after 970-973) first: skipped.
#
# Class quests (Druids; Auberdine has the flights to Rut'theran Village and
# Moonglade, the class's own teleport does the rest):
# - Night Elf Druids: A Lesson to Learn and Trial of the Lake (26, 29) after
#   the first hearth, the Darkshore half pendant on the north loop; Trial of
#   the Sea Lion (272) is finished with the Westfall half from the Stormwind
#   stop (04-redridge-mountains) on arrival in Auberdine (06-ashenvale).
# - Night Elf and Skyborne Druids: Cat Form (98393 to 98397, Mathrengyl
#   Bearwalker, the Great Cat Spirit or the Avatar of Saeyleenan in
#   Moonglade) at the end, about level 21, before the boat.
# - Night Elf Druids: Cure Poison (6121-6125: Lessons Anew from Mathrengyl on
#   the A Lesson to Learn trip, the Cliffspring sampler on the north loop,
#   Alanndarian's herbs after the third loop and the deer on the last legs,
#   Power over Poison on the Cat Form trip). Forever rewards Cure Poison only
#   through it. Earthroot needs Herbalism or the Stormwind purchase
#   (02-westfall); the moonkin caves for the Lunar Fungus are from
#   Forever's quest data (quest 6123), the Lunar Fungal Blooms objects.json's.
# - Skyborne Druids hand Sheldras's Moonglade welcome (94914, from their start
#   guide) to Dendrite on the Cat Form trip.

