# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Auberdine

step Auberdine
  only Human,Dwarf,Gnome,Skyborne
  zone Darkshore
  tip The boat docks west of the village. The flight master stands on the hill south of the inn; the quest givers are spread along the main street.
  accept 3524                                 -- Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde
  sethome "Auberdine" only Human,Dwarf,Gnome,Skyborne
  accept 98025                                -- The WANTED poster outside the inn
  accept 2118                                 -- Tharnariun Treetender
  accept 984                                  -- Terenthis
  accept 954                                  -- Thundris Windweaver, north end of the village
  accept 958

step Auberdine
  zone Darkshore
  accept 4811                                 -- Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The beach

step The beach
  tip Tide Crawlers scuttle along the shore below the village; Buzzbox 827 stands on the beach just south of the docks. Darkshore Threshers swim in the shallows. The Beached Sea Creature lies on the shore just south of the village.
  collect 12242 quest 3524                    -- Sea Creature Bones
  collect 12238 quest 1141 optional @36.1,44.9 -- Darkshore Grouper: fish from the pier

step Auberdine
  turnin 3524                                 -- Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde
  accept 4681
  turnin 1141 optional                        -- Gubber Blump
  sethome "Auberdine" only NightElf

step The skeletal turtle
  collect 12289 quest 4681                    -- Sea Turtle Remains, on the beach west of the docks; underwater
  turnin 4681                                 -- Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde

step Ameth'Aran
  tip Sentinel Tysha Moonblade stands at the north edge of the ruins. Cursed, Writhing and Wailing Highborne haunt them; Anaya Dawnrunner's ghost walks among them, Jai'vhanel the owl circles east of them. The two tablets lie in the ruins; a Beached Sea Turtle lies on the shore west of them.
  accept 4722                                 -- Beached Sea Turtle
  accept 953                                  -- Sentinel Tysha Moonblade
  collect 5360 quest 958                      -- Highborne Relics
  collect 281038 quest 98025                  -- Feather of Jai'vhanel
  interact 17188 quest 953.1 @43.3,58.7 map 1439 -- Read the Lay of Ameth'Aran
  interact 17189 quest 953.2 @42.6,63.1 map 1439 -- Read the Fall of Ameth'Aran
  turnin 953

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- First loop: south-east and north-east

step Bears and the Blackwood camp
  when onquest 984
  tip Kill Rabid Thistle Bears in the hills east of Auberdine, then walk up to the furbolg camp south-east of them: nothing to kill yet.
  goto 39.9,53.9
  complete 984 @39.9,53.9                     # any of four furbolg camps completes it; this is the one by the bears (#560)

step The red crystal
  tip Climb the eastern mountains east of Ameth'Aran; the Mysterious Red Crystal sits on a ledge.
  interact 175524 quest 4811.1                -- Mysterious Red Crystal
  complete 4811

step Plagued bears
  when onquest 2118
  tip Rabid Thistle Bears roam the hills just east of Auberdine. Use Tharnariun's Hope on one and lead it back to him.
  goto 47.5,33.8
  complete 2118 @38.21,52.59                  -- the Rabid Thistle Bears nearest Tharnariun

step Bashal'Aran
  tip North along the hills. Asterion waits in the ruins of Bashal'Aran; Wild Grells and Vile Sprites fill them, Deth'ryll Satyrs the eastern edge. Buzzbox 411 stands by the road west of the ruins; a Beached Sea Creature lies on the shore on the way to him.
  turnin 954                                  -- Asterion
  accept 955
  collect 5336 quest 955 @44.6,36.6 map 1439 -- Grell Earrings
  turnin 955
  accept 956
  collect 5338 quest 956 @45.5,36.5 map 1439 -- Ancient Moonstone Seal: Deth'ryll Satyrs
  turnin 956
  accept 957
  accept 4723                                 -- Beached Sea Creature

step Auberdine
  turnin 958
  turnin 98025
  turnin 4811                                 -- Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea
  accept 4812
  turnin 4722                                 -- Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde
  turnin 4723
  turnin 2118                                 -- Tharnariun Treetender

step Hearth to Auberdine
  hearth "Auberdine" only Human,Dwarf,Gnome,Skyborne
  turnin 984                                  -- Terenthis
  accept 985
  use 14338 @37.8,44.0 map 1439
  collect 14339 quest 4812                    -- Fill the tube at the moonwell in the village
  vendor nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Second loop

step Blackwood furbolgs
  zone Darkshore
  tip Blackwood Pathfinders and Windtalkers hold the camp south-east of Auberdine.
  kill 2167 quest 985
  kill 2324 quest 985

step The southern beaches
  tip Follow the coast south past Ameth'Aran: one Beached Sea Creature lies on the shore west of the Grove, another further south near Remtravel's Excavation. Three more remains lie further south-west among Greymist Oracles and Tidehunters (18-20): the guide leaves them for the last loop, when you are closer to their level.
  accept 4728                                 -- Beached Sea Creature

step The red crystal
  tip Back north-east into the mountains to the crystal.
  turnin 4812                                 -- Mysterious Red Crystal
  accept 4813

step Auberdine
  turnin 985                                  -- Terenthis
  turnin 4813                                 -- Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea
  vendor nearest
  turnin 4728                                 -- Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde

step Boat to Stormwind Harbor
  only NightElf
  zone Darkshore
  goto 30.76,40.92 "Boat to Stormwind Harbor"

step Stormwind flight master
  only NightElf
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 66.3,62.7 "Stormwind flight master"
  getfp "Stormwind" only NightElf

step Woo Ping
  only Warrior,NightElf
  zone Stormwind City
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Two-Handed Swords" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Two-Handed Swords from Woo Ping (Trade District, 10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest.
  train 11867                         -- Woo Ping

step Woo Ping
  only Rogue,NightElf
  zone Stormwind City
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Swords" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Swords from Woo Ping (Trade District, 10 silver); a sword in the main hand levels a Rogue steadily.
  train 11867                         -- Woo Ping

step Elwynn Forest
  only NightElf
  zone Elwynn Forest
  goto 43.5,65.3 "Elwynn Forest"

step Class trainer
  only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  zone Elwynn Forest
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock

step Shaman trainer
  only Shaman
  train class only Shaman -- Teo Hammerstorm in Dun Morogh; Goldshire has no shaman trainer

step Druid trainer
  only Druid
  train class only Druid -- Alfina Nightgaze in Alterac Mountains; Goldshire has no druid trainer

step Remy "Two Times"
  zone Darkshore
  accept 40
  turnin 40
  accept 35

step Hearth to Auberdine
  only NightElf
  hearth "Auberdine"

step Darkshore
  only NightElf
  zone Darkshore
  goto 42.4,61.8 "Darkshore"

step Ameth'Aran
  zone Darkshore
  tip The flame burns in the south of Ameth'Aran.
  interact 16393 quest 957.1 @42.4,61.8 map 1439 -- Ancient Flame

step Bashal'Aran
  zone Darkshore
  turnin 957                                  -- Asterion

step Hearth to Auberdine
  hearth "Auberdine" only Human,Dwarf,Gnome,Skyborne
  vendor nearest

step Auberdine
  tip Follow the road north.
  vendor nearest

step Auberdine
  vendor nearest

step Darkshore
  zone Darkshore
  goto 36.4,45.6 "Darkshore"

step Boat to Stormwind Harbor
  zone Darkshore
  goto 30.76,40.92 "Boat to Stormwind Harbor"

step Into Elwynn Forest
  zone Elwynn Forest
  goto 32.3,49.9 "Into Elwynn Forest"
